Package: qpaTutorials
Type: Package
Title: Tutorials for Quantitative Political Analysis at Penn State
Version: 0.3.0
Author: Suzanna Linn [aut]
Maintainer: Suzanna Linn <sld8@psu.edu>
Description: Interactive learnr tutorials supporting PLSC 309H: Quantitative
    Political Analysis at Penn State University. Tutorials cover R basics,
    levels of measurement, univariate and bivariate description, statistical
    inference, linear regression, and logistic regression.
